=== width 80
[bold,italic,double-underline]Changelog[]

All notable changes are documented here.

[bold,underline][Unreleased][]

[bold]Added[]

• A [yellow]--dry-run[] flag that shows what would change without touching a file.
• Support for [yellow]~/.config/frobnicate/frobnicate.toml[], read before the project's
  own file.

[bold]Fixed[]

• A crash when a file name contained a combining character, such as [yellow]é[].
• The progress bar overwrote the last line of the output on narrow terminals; it
  now stays within the terminal width.

[bold,underline][2.1.0] - 2026-09-12[]

[bold]Changed[]

• Jobs default to the number of CPU cores, up to [yellow]8[].
• Error messages name the file first, then the reason.

[bold]Deprecated[]

• [yellow]--legacy-output[], which will go away in 3.0. Use [yellow]--format=plain[].

[bold,underline][2.0.0] - 2026-05-02[]

[bold]Removed[]

• The [yellow]--old-syntax[] flag and the [yellow].frobrc[] file.

[bold]Changed[]

• [bold]Breaking:[] the exit code for partial failure is [yellow]1[], no longer [yellow]3[].
